<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6898" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνά-ληψις</span></b> , later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λημψις,</span>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, hyperdor.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-λαψις</span> Ti 
			Locr.
		<i><span class="en">
			100c
		</span></i>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>taking
			up,</i> e.g. <i>suspension</i> in a sling, <i>fixing</i> a
			bandage, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Off.</u>
				9
			</span></i>; <i>looping</i> or <i>tying up</i> of vines, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1692.20
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1631.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>receiving back</i> into a family, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Abd.</u>
				5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>acquirement</i> of knowledge, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				1.31
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
			</span></i> l.c., <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>P.</u>
				1.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.1
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.351e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>assumption</i> of an office, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Prien.</u>
				123
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδήματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>OGI</u>
					383.102
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>being taken up</i> or <i>away,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Psalm.Solom.
				4.20
			</span></i>; <i>ascension,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ev.Luc.
				9.51
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>reception, entertainment</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				888.36
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thrace</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>7.</b>
			<i>assimilation,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφῆς</span> Menon <i><span class="en">
				<u>Iatr.</u>
				25.48
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>recovery,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μνήμης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					451a20
				</span></i>
			; <i>means of regaining,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Publ.</u>
				9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>making good, making amends,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				5.65
			</span></i>; <i>refreshing</i> of soldiers after hard work, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				3.87.1
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Par.</u>
				40
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάληψιν ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Demetr.Com.Nov.
					1.10
				</span></i>
			:—<i>recovery</i> from illness, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.27
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				83e
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>repair,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				13.1.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				1.83.11
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>repetition,</i> [<i><span class="en">
				Longin.
			</span></i>]<i><span class="en">
				<u>Rh.</u>
				p.200H.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
